      "content": "i hear you about the help stuff but it just feels so clinical and fake. like, you're just saying what you're supposed to say. but i'm being real. if i truly believe that leaving is the only way to help my family and find some peace, why is it so wrong to think about it? isnt it just a way to finally fix the mess i've made?",
